Error: Jet.FailureDomainMismatch: `?` only works on a fallible value, not Int (a whole number)
  --> Tests/UI/E0403_question_mark_on_a_plain_value.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     print(count?)
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: `?` unwraps success or returns early with the failure
 Fix: Call something that returns `T E!` or an optional value, or remove `?`
